## 7. No warranty

EFI Partition Manager is provided **"as is"**, without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular
purpose and non-infringement. EFI Partition Manager changes partition tables and can
wipe partitions: you use it at your own risk, and you are responsible for
keeping backups.

